  "只添加所选结果，原始属性保留。完成后可在“数据”查看新属性，或在“显示”切换着色。无效邻域以 NaN 和 normal_valid=0 标记。计算不改变坐标，新增属性按下方选择的位置插入。": "Only selected features are added; original attributes are retained. Inspect results in Data or change coloring in Display. Invalid neighborhoods use NaN and normal_valid=0. Coordinates are unchanged; new fields follow your chosen column position.",
