  "导出所选 / 合并为一个文件": "Export selected / merge into one file",
  "保留 XYZ 和数值属性；多选时合并为一个文件，缺失属性填 NaN。按原始坐标拼接，不配准、不去重。按“数据”页列顺序保存；多选以首文件为准，新属性追加。标签写为标准字段名。": "Retains XYZ and scalar attributes. Multiple selections merge into one file; missing fields use NaN. Uses original coordinates without registration or deduplication. Export follows Data column order; multiple files use the first file's order and append new fields. Tags become standard field names.",
